    ⚡ HOW THE PROGRAM WORKS:
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
    🔹 CORE TECHNOLOGY
    Classroom70x operates through a client-server architecture where the teacher's computer acts as the central hub, connecting to student devices via local network or cloud. The software creates a virtual classroom environment where teachers can broadcast their screen, share resources, monitor student activity, and conduct real-time assessments. Students join sessions using simple access codes on any device with a browser, requiring no installation. The platform supports various interaction modes including quizzes, polls, collaborative whiteboards, and group activities .
    
    🔹 KEY FEATURES
    Classroom70x includes comprehensive teaching and learning tools:

    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    📺 SCREEN SHARING        │ Broadcast teacher screen to all students
    📝 DIGITAL WHITEBOARD    │ Interactive collaborative workspace
    📊 REAL-TIME ASSESSMENT  │ Create instant quizzes and polls
    🔍 STUDENT MONITORING    │ See student screens and progress
    📁 RESOURCE SHARING      │ Distribute materials instantly
    👥 GROUP COLLABORATION   │ Break-out rooms for team work
    📈 PROGRESS TRACKING     │ Individual and class analytics
    🔒 SECURE CLASSROOM      │ Password-protected sessions
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
